# Beadeaux Smog (bastok 33): High Bear in the Metalworks, qm1 in Beadeaux. The guard (Bastok fame level 4), the offer
# 731, the Corrupted Dirt from qm1 while accepted, 732 and the Chakram. High Bear's default is 730 (he has no script);
# qm1's default is the FOUL_SMELLING_SOIL_IS_SPILLING_OUT message. No other quest or mission names either.
# qm1 shows only in rain or a squall (Beadeaux's Zone.lua, onZoneWeatherChange). The char starts in Beadeaux, where the
# weather rolled at the zone's start (the harness's pinned weather seed) shows it.
lists Metalworks/High_Bear/onTrigger Metalworks/High_Bear/onTrade Metalworks/onEventFinish/731 Metalworks/onEventFinish/732 Beadeaux/qm1/onTrigger
char zone=Beadeaux pos=-82.3,1.056,-140.1
fame Bastok 224
item BoneChip
login
trigger qm1                     # available: section 2 fails, the default message
finish-if-event
warp 25.2,-14,5.5 Metalworks
trade High_Bear BoneChip x1     # available: no trade handler, nothing
trigger High_Bear               # fame 224 (level 3): his default 730
finish
fame Bastok 225
trigger High_Bear               # fame level 4: the offer, 731
finish                          # accepted
trigger High_Bear               # accepted, no dirt: his default 730
finish
trade High_Bear BoneChip x1     # accepted: nothing
warp -82.3,1.056,-140.1 Beadeaux
trigger qm1                     # accepted, no dirt: the Corrupted Dirt
finish-if-event
trigger qm1                     # the dirt held: section 2 fails, the default message
finish-if-event
warp 25.2,-14,5.5 Metalworks
trigger High_Bear               # the dirt held: 732
finish                          # completed: Chakram, fame +40, Beadeaux Surveyor; the dirt kept
trigger High_Bear               # completed: 730
finish
